{"ref":"BDB, נֶ֫שֶׁךְ","hw":"נֶ֫שֶׁךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֶ֫שֶׁךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>interest, usury</strong> (lit. <em>something bitten off</em>);—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:24\" href=\"/Exodus.22.24\">Ex 22:24</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.20\">Dt 23:20</a>;—c. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂים עַל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:24\" href=\"/Exodus.22.24\">Ex 22:24</a> (E); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָקַח מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.36\">Lv 25:36</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵשִׁיב מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.17\">Ez 18:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָקַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.12\">22:12</a> (no prep.), <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֶשֶׁךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.37\">Lv 25:37</a> <em>at interest</em>, so <a data-ref=\"Psalms 15:5\" href=\"/Psalms.15.5\">ψ 15:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.8\">Ez 18:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.13\">13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.8\">Pr 28:8</a> <em>by usury;</em> as acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.20\">Dt 23:20</a><sup>(×3)</sup>.","next":"BDB, נָשַׁךְ²","prev":"BDB, נָשַׁךְ"}